      "prompt": "A brewery grain tower is a cylinder of radius $4$ m with a conical roof of the same radius. The roof's sloping edge measures $5$ m from the rim to the peak. The tower must hold exactly $208\\pi$ m$^3$ in total. How tall must the cylindrical part be, in meters?",
